Here is the commit message:
SOLR-3779: fix for DIH LineEntityProcessor

git-svn-id: https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/lucene/dev/trunk@1384816 13f79535-47bb-0310-9956-ffa450edef68

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the `LineEntityProcessor` not properly handling the end of input scenario, which resulted in it only processing the first file when used in conjunction with `FileListEntityProcessor`. The lack of resource cleanup when reaching the end of input led to potential resource leaks and improper state management.

Here is the patch:
